hadiths[25]{hadithnumber,text}:
"274","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke Hasan bin Ali ne sadaqe ki khajooron mein se ek khajoor li aur use apne munh mein dal liya. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne un se farmaya: 'Kikh, kikh' — to unhon ne use phenk diya. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Kya tum nahin jante ke sadaqa hamare liye halal nahin hai?'"
"275","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Hasan bin Ali ne (ek khajoor) li, phir unhon ne isi ki misl zikr ki."
"276","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas sadaqe ki khajooron mein se khajooren lai gayin, to Aap ne us mein ek hukm farmaya. Aur Aap ne Hasan ya Husain ko apne kandhe par uthaya; achanak un ka luaab behne laga. To Aap ne dekha to un ke munh mein sadaqe ki ek khajoor thi, to Aap ne unhen harkat di aur unhon ne use phenk diya. To Aap ne farmaya: Kya tum nahin jante ke sadaqa hamare liye halal nahin hai?"
"277","[AI-translation] Isi sanad se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Sadaqe mein hadd se badhne wala use rokne wale ki manind hai.'"
"278","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas jab ghair ghar walon ki taraf se khana laya jata to Aap us ke bare mein poochte. Phir agar kaha jata: Hadiya hai, to khate. Aur agar kaha jata: Sadaqa hai, to farmate: Khao — aur khud na khate."
"279","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: Miskeen woh phirne wala nahin hai jise ek ya do niwale, ek ya do luqme, ya ek ya do khajooren wapas kar den. Balke miskeen woh hai jo itni ghina nahin pata jo use ghani kare, aur woh logon se chipat kar nahin mangta ya use logon se chipat kar mangne se haya aati hai."
"280","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Miskeen nahin hai — phir unhon ne isi ki misl zikr ki. Rawi ne kaha: Shu'bah ko us ke qaul: Ya ek ya do khajooren mein shak hua."
"281","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: Mujhe pasand nahin ke mere paas Uhud ke barabar sona ho phir mujh par teesri (raat) aae jabke mere paas us mein se deenar ho; koi cheez nahin jo main qarz ke liye rokun."
"282","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Ek aadmi ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Main kaise sadaqa karun? Aap ne farmaya: Jabke tum tandrust, bakheel, zindagi ki ummeed rakhte hue aur faqr se darte hue ho. Aur mohlat na do yahan tak ke jab tumhari jaan tumhare halq tak pahunch jae, tum kaho: Mera maal falan ke liye aur falan ke liye, jabke woh unhi ka hai."
"283","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: 'Ghina kasrat samaan se nahin hai, lekin ghina nafs ki ghina hai.'"
"284","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Ghana kasrat samaan se nahin hai, lekin ghana nafs ki ghana hai.'"
"285","[AI-translation] Hazrat Ibn Umar (Raziyallahu anhuma) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: 'Sadaqa dene wala us ke lene wale hajatmand se ajr mein bada nahin hai.'"
"286","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Qayamat qaim nahin hogi yahan tak ke maal kasrat se ho jae aur behne lage yahan tak ke maal ka malik fikr kare ke us ka sadaqa us se qabool kiya jae aur use pesh kare. To jis par pesh kiya gaya woh kahe: Mujhe is mein koi hajat nahin.'"
"287","[AI-translation] Hazrat Abu Hurairah (Raziyallahu anhu) se Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se riwayat hai ke Aap ne farmaya: 'Beshak main giri hui khajoor pata hun to use khane ke liye uthata hun phir darta hun ke woh sadaqe se ho to use phenk deta hun.'"
"288","[AI-translation] Hazrat Asma bint Yazid (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main Nabi (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas apni khala ke sath aai — aur woh nayi dulhan thin — taake ham Aap se bai'at karen. To Aap ne un par sone ke kanghan, aur sone ki anguthiyan dekhin, to un se farmaya: 'Kya tum pasand karti ho ke Allah tumhen aag ke do kanghan pahnae?' To unhon ne unhen apne hathon se utar diya, aur unhen phenk diya; main nahin janti phir unhen kis ne liya. Phir Aap ne farmaya: Tum mein se ek chaandi ke do rangeen ya do halqe kyun na bana le phir use ambar ya wars ya za'fran se rang le?"
"289","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Salamah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ek din mere paas tashreef laae jabke Aap ka chehra murjhaya hua tha. To main ne gumaan kiya ke woh kisi cheez se hai jo Aap ko pahunchi. To main ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Mujhe kya hai ke main Aap ko murjhaye chehre wala dekhti hun? To Aap ne farmaya: 'Kya tum ne saat deenar nahin dekhe jo hamare paas aae the, ham ne shaam ki aur ham ne unhen kharch nahin kiya.'"
"290","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Salamah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ki biwi Zainab Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aain aur unhon ne kaha: 'Beshak mere shauhar faqeer hain, aur mere bhai ke yateem bachche meri parwarish mein hain. Aur main un par aise aur aise kharch karti hun, aur har haal mein. To kya mere liye jo main ne un par kharch kiya us mein ajr hai? To Aap ne farmaya: 'Han.' Aur woh hathon se hunar mand thin."
"291","[AI-translation] Hazrat Umm Salamah (Raziyallahu anha) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak Umm Salamah ke bachche meri parwarish mein hain, aur un ke paas kuch nahin hai siwae us ke jo main ne un par kharch kiya aur main unhen aise aur aise nahin chhodungi. To kya mere liye ajr hai agar main ne un par kharch kiya? To Aap ne farmaya: 'Han.'"
"292","[AI-translation] Zainab Saqafiyyah se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Main ne apna maal jama kiya tha to main ne kaha main use apne paas sab se pakeeza jagah rakhungi. To main ne apne dil mein kaha: Agar main use Allah ke raste mein Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke un lashkaron mein se kisi lashkar par kharch karun jinhen Aap bhejte hain, ya us se kisi Musalman laundi ko khareed kar aazad karun, ya use miskeenon par sadaqa karun, ya use faqeer shauhar aur apni parwarish mein yateem bhatijon par sadaqa karun. To main Aishah ke paas is ke bare mein poochne aai. Phir Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) tashreef laae aur farmaya: Aey Aishah! 'Yeh kaun hai?' Unhon ne kaha: Ibn Umm Abd ki biwi. Aap ne farmaya: 'Woh kyun aai hai?' To Aishah ne Aap ko woh bataya. To Aap ne farmaya: Woh use apne faqeer shauhar aur yateem bhatijon par kharch kare; us ke liye dohra ajr hoga."
"293","[AI-translation] Un ke walid se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Abdullah bin Mas'ud ki biwi Zainab hathon se hunar mand thin; woh cheez banatin phir use bechtin. Aur Abdullah ke paas maal na tha aur na un ki aulad ke paas. To un ki biwi ne kaha: Tum jan loge ke main sadaqa karti hun. To Abdullah ne kaha: Mujhe pasand nahin ke tum karo agar tumhare liye jo tum kharch karti ho us mein ajr na ho. To woh Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aain aur Aap ko qissa sunaya. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Un par kharch karo to tumhare liye jo tum ne un par kharch kiya us mein ajr hai.'"
"294","[AI-translation] Sha'bi (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke Abdullah ki biwi Zainab ne Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se rishtedaron par sadaqe ke bare mein poocha. To Aap ne farmaya: 'Rishtedaron par sadaqa ghair rishtedaron par dohra kiya jata hai.'"
"295","[AI-translation] Ibrahim (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ki biwi Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aain aur kaha: Ya Rasulullah! Beshak mere paas zewar hai, aur meri parwarish mein yateem bhatije hain to kya main apne zewar ki zakat un mein rakhun? To Aap ne farmaya: 'Han.'"
"296","[AI-translation] Ibrahim (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ki biwi Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aain aur kaha: Beshak meri parwarish mein mere bhai ke bete ya Abdullah ke bhai ke bete hain to kya main apne maal ki zakat un mein rakhun? To Aap ne farmaya: 'Han.' Mufaddal ne kaha: Mughirah ko us ke bhai ke beton ya Abdullah ke bhai ke beton mein shak hua."
"297","[AI-translation] Ibrahim (Rahimahullah) se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ki biwi Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ke paas aain aur kaha: Beshak woh khafeef aur Abdullah par kharch wali hai, to kya mere liye kafi hai ke main apne maal ka sadaqa un mein rakhun? To Aap ne farmaya: 'Han.'"
"298","[AI-translation] Abdullah ki biwi Zainab se riwayat hai ke unhon ne kaha: Hamen Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne khutba diya, to hamen sadaqe par ubhara. To farmaya: 'Aey auraton ki jama'at! Sadaqa karo agarche apne zewaron se, kyunke beshak tum Qayamat ke din jahannam mein se aksar hogi.' Unhon ne kaha: Aur Abdullah khafeef ul yadain the, aur Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) par ro'b dala gaya tha. To main ne Abdullah se kaha: Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se apne shauharon aur apni parwarish mein yateemon par sadaqe ke bare mein poocho. To unhon ne kaha: Nahin balke tum khud poocho. To main darwaze ki taraf chali; to Ansar mein se ek aurat thi us ki hajat meri hajat jaisi thi. To hamare paas Bilal nikle. To ham ne un se kaha: Hamare liye Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se poocho: Kya hamare liye apne shauharon aur apni parwarish mein yateemon par sadaqe se kifayat ho jaegi? To Bilal dakhil hue. To Rasulullah (Sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: 'Darwaze par kaun hai?' To unhon ne kaha: Abdullah ki biwi Zainab, aur ek aur aurat; woh dono Aap se poochti hain: Kya un donon ke liye apne shauharon aur apni parwarish mein yateemon par sadaqe se kifayat ho jaegi? To Aap ne farmaya: 'Un donon mein sadaqe ka ajr aur rishtedari ka ajr hai.'"
